	(text "LIVE: GND = AGND = BUS-; nothing on this connector leaves the enclosure. +24V and +5V are NOT used (PV-PWR\nallocation 0 / 50 mA; the live 24 V is already over its rating): pins left open. +3V3 feeds the MCU, so the\npower board's 3.3 V signals and VDDIO share one rail and one power-up order (no back-powering)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 122.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "288cce27-cd0b-575e-8b88-de0b07fb07a5")
	)
	(text "RESET AND WATCHDOG (TPS3828-33)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38392c68-92a7-5917-a771-07f9a56c441f")
	)
	(text "RESET (open drain) holds XRSn below 2.93 V and for 200 ms after; no WDI edge for 0.9-2.5 s -> reset.\nXRSn 4.7k pull-up and 10 nF (SPRSP61C table 5-1: 2.2-10k, <= 100 nF). XRSn also clears the heartbeat\nmonoflop, so every MCU reset sets the trip latch. +5V / +24V supervision: on the power board (RDY)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 60.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cca02feb-2195-5249-9edb-81968f2eb87e")
	)
	(text "PC CONNECTOR (GEN/INTERFACES.PY PC; AGND = GND ON THIS BOARD)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
